commit fceaae1ba6abf1f26ad1a90e1cbe1b153d0f9f64
Author: hvn_hxtuan <hvn_hxtuan@humax-networks.com>
Date:   Mon Mar 9 09:39:26 2026 +0000

    [HP2236BVA-37] Fix SSH/Telnet access issue when enabled via CWMP

    After enabling SSH/Telnet(WEB/CWMP):
    - Allow access from LAN side and block from WAN side.
    - Enable the Service Control rule related to SSH/Telnet in AIS_Whitelist
    Fix issue for HalSecurity_applyAccessControl function

    Change-Id: Id3ba4e5b7429db2f493807a0ee336a536cab7521

diff --git a/tclinux_phoenix/apps/hni/cwmpclient/ext/openwrt/scripts/functions/tr098/X_AIS_SSH b/tclinux_phoenix/apps/hni/cwmpclient/ext/openwrt/scripts/functions/tr098/X_AIS_SSH
index 5afa13045de..9edb152eb21 100644
